# CodeFabric's exact workstation and CI tool contract.
#
# This file is shell syntax so setup scripts and GitHub Actions can consume one source.
# rust-toolchain.toml and the dated extractor file remain Rustup's selection inputs;
# scripts/tool-versions.sh verifies that those files agree with these identities.

